cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the software itself."
title: "Cislunar Orbital Network"
abstract: >
  MATLAB codebase for computing reachable-set atlases in the planar Earth-Moon CR3BP,
  inferring pairwise family accessibility from reachable-set overlap, and assembling
  weighted cislunar orbital networks from thirteen representative periodic orbit families
  at a common Jacobi constant. Associated with the paper "Orbital Networks in the
  Three-Body Problem" by Braik and Ross.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-05-27
license: MIT
